d_pages","html":"18"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>；单关系ARS见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>三性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"88a9a11cf6ba5c17\" href=\"?note=88a9a11cf6ba5c17\" title=\"56-df-inductive\">56-df-inductive</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9e48c575a2e18666\" href=\"?note=9e48c575a2e18666\" title=\"56-df-increasing\">56-df-increasing</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Increasing}(A,\\to))\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{Increasing}(A,\\to))\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书陈述已核对；独立的短证明已复核：假设有无限链f，由Inductive选共同后继b。严格增长的自然数秩满足μ(f(n))≥n，另一方面f(n)→*b给μ(f(n))≤μ(b)，取n&gt;μ(b)矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-inductive","status":"resolved","id":"88a9a1